  "id": "dynamical/asos-parquet",
  "title": "Global Airport Weather GeoParquet (1940-present)",
  "description": "Historical and near-real-time surface weather observations from global ASOS and AWOS airport stations spanning 1940 to present, comprising approximately 1.8 billion decoded METAR reports. Each record captures temperature, dewpoint, wind speed and direction, precipitation, visibility, and atmospheric pressure in both imperial and metric units, with station point geometry embedded per record. Files are partitioned by year and stored as GeoParquet.",
